and she's having

13:34.520 --> 13:37.787
rough sex with a stranger, and
I had to get out of the house.

13:39.407 --> 13:43.493
Honey, I just don't understand
why we can't work things out.

13:43.495 --> 13:45.612
Okay, I'll tell you again.

13:45.614 --> 13:47.614
Oh, this part
is never good.

13:47.616 --> 13:50.450
I'm tired of living
with a child.

13:50.452 --> 13:53.403
I'm tired of being
more of a mother than a wife.

13:53.405 --> 13:54.871
Whoa, oh,
whoa, whoa.

13:54.873 --> 13:57.123
You are not more of
a mother than a wife.

13:57.125 --> 13:58.614
Really? Who picks out
your clothes?

13:58.639 --> 13:59.710
You.

13:59.711 --> 14:00.922
Who tells you
when to go to sleep?

14:00.947 --> 14:02.147
You.

14:02.264 --> 14:04.130
Who does all the cooking
and cleaning around here?

14:04.132 --> 14:05.999
The cooking and the
cleaning ladies.

14:06.001 --> 14:07.166
Before we were rich!

14:07.168 --> 14:09.386
You.

14:09.388 --> 14:12.722
Look, Walden, you're a sweet guy

14:12.724 --> 14:15.141
and I'll always love you,

14:15.143 --> 14:17.561
but I can't live
with Peter Pan anymore.

14:17.563 --> 14:19.946
Uh, now, now,
to be fair,

14:19.948 --> 14:22.181
uh, Peter Pan
didn't want to grow up.

14:22.183 --> 14:25.702
Uh, from what I understand,
Walden's just never had to.

14:26.787 --> 14:29.072
Sorry.

14:29.074 --> 14:33.192
Seemed important
up here.

14:33.194 --> 14:36.830
Down here,
not so much.

14:38.466 --> 14:41.334
Bridget, believe
me, I can grow up.

14:41.336 --> 14:42.502
Oh, please.

14:42.504 --> 14:44.370
At least give me
a chance to try.

14:46.892 --> 14:48.925
I gave you 15 years.

14:48.927 --> 14:50.760
It's over!

14:50.762 --> 14:52.979
Okay.

14:54.432 --> 14:55.815
Can I at least play

14:55.817 --> 14:57.767
a little Donkey Kong
with Alan before I go?

14:57.769 --> 14:58.852
Are you insane?!

14:58.854 --> 14:59.853
Get out!

14:59.855 --> 15:01.738
Oh, yeah, fine,
I'm insane!

15:02.774 --> 15:04.858
Come on, Alan!

15:04.860 --> 15:07.744
Thank you for the water
and the...

15:09.497 --> 15:11.831
Hold on.

15:14.336 --> 15:15.852
Let's go.

15:22.593 --> 15:25.762
Where does she get off
calling me a child?

15:25.764 --> 15:28.848
Um, you seem a little upset;
maybe I should drive us. Um...

15:28.850 --> 15:30.634
She is a stupid-head.

15:30.636 --> 15:32.302
Oh, oh, white Volkswagen.
Huh?

15:32.304 --> 15:33.803
Huh? Come on.

15:35.640 --> 15:36.973
Oh, wait, wait,
I've got an idea.

15:36.975 --> 15:39.092
Why don't we stop,
have a drink and talk about it.

15:39.094 --> 15:40.977
Drinking is not the answer.

15:40.979 --> 15:44.430
No, stopping is the answer!

15:46.651 --> 15:49.435
Oh, dear God,
where is that toilet paper?!

16:28.809 --> 16:30.777
Oh, boy.

16:35.950 --> 16:38.151
Alan?

16:38.153 --> 16:41.121
Yeah?

16:41.123 --> 16:44.290
Why are you
lying on top of me?

16:44.292 --> 16:47.510
'Cause I didn't want
to be on the bottom?

16:51.265 --> 16:53.366
I think we're naked.

16:53.368 --> 16:56.502
Yeah. You can ignore
what's going on down there.

16:58.222 --> 17:00.473
That was a
morning reflex.

17:02.109 --> 17:04.144
Could you get it
off of me, please?

17:04.146 --> 17:07.063
Absolutely.
Absolutely.

17:11.485 --> 17:12.952
Do you remember anything?

17:12.954 --> 17:14.237
Uh...

17:14.239 --> 17:17.690
we went to a liquor store,
and then we came back here.

17:19.527 --> 17:21.527
Then we went
skinny dipping.

17:21.529 --> 17:22.579
Right, right.

17:22.581 --> 17:24.581
Whose idea was that?

17:24.583 --> 17:26.082
Mine.

17:26.084 --> 17:28.651
Shh.

17:31.722 --> 17:33.790
♪ Men. ♪

17:35.259 --> 17:37.927
Okay, your pants
are clean.

17:37.929 --> 17:39.679
Thank you.

17:39.681 --> 17:42.899
adult diapers.

17:42.901 --> 17:45.735
Look, Walden was driving
ridiculously fast,

17:45.737 --> 17:47.487
and-and I have
a nervous bladder.

17:47.489 --> 17:48.605
Save it, Zippy.

17:48.607 --> 17:51.541
This is not my first
pee stain rodeo with you.

17:56.030 --> 17:57.247
Hi. Is Charlie here?

17:57.249 --> 17:59.032
Oh, God, another one.

17:59.034 --> 18:01.951
You deal with it.

18:01.953 --> 18:04.420
Um, hi.
I'm-I'm Charlie's brother Alan.

18:04.422 --> 18:05.421
I'm Penelope.

18:05.423 --> 18:06.589
Is he here?

18:06.591 --> 18:09.592
Uh, maybe you better sit down.

18:09.594 --> 18:11.410
Is-Is everything okay?

18:11.412 --> 18:13.596
Um, no.

18:13.598 --> 18:17.250
Penelope, the-the thing is,
uh, Charlie passed away.

18:17.252 --> 18:18.802
What?

18:18.804 --> 18:20.553
It was very sudden.

18:20.555 --> 18:22.355
Oh, my God.

18:22.357 --> 18:24.440
I'm sorry, he was just
such a terrific guy.

18:24.442 --> 18:25.859
I can't believe he's gone.

18:25.861 --> 18:28.211
Hey, what's going on?

18:28.213 --> 18:31.314
Hello, I'm Penelope.

18:31.316 --> 18:33.650
Hi. I'm Walden.

18:33.652 --> 18:34.984
What are you crying about?

18:34.986 --> 18:36.886
I have no idea.

18:36.888 --> 18:39.489
Don't worry about me,
I'll let myself out.

18:40.324 --> 18:41.491
You smell good.

18:41.493 --> 18:44.244
Oh, thank you.
It's baby shampoo.

18:44.246 --> 18:46.012
"What are you crying about?"

18:46.014 --> 18:48.331
"I have no idea."

18:50.450 --> 18:52.969
Oh, Bridget. Hi.

18:52.971 --> 18:54.220
Hi.

18:54.222 --> 18:55.621
I came to talk to Walden.

18:55.623 --> 18:56.506
Really?

18:56.508 --> 18:57.507
Yeah, I think maybe

18:57.509 --> 18:59.259
I've been a little
hard on him.

18:59.261 --> 19:01.811
Well, um...

19:01.813 --> 19:02.812
Bridget?

19:02.814 --> 19:04.564
Hey.

19:04.566 --> 19:05.915
Walden?

19:05.917 --> 19:07.817
Look who came
to talk to you, Walden.

19:07.819 --> 19:08.818
Your wife.

19:08.820 --> 19:10.486
You're married?

19:10.488 --> 19:11.771
Oh, yeah, long time married.

19:11.773 --> 19:12.805
Uh, they just met.

19:12.807 --> 19:14.490
This is Penelope, my girlfriend.

19:14.492 --> 19:16.693
What?
Shut up and walk.

19:19.246 --> 19:20.430
I'm-I'm glad you came.

19:20.432 --> 19:21.865
Come, sit-sit down.

19:21.867 --> 19:24.284
When I saw you with that girl,

19:24.286 --> 19:26.286
I thought that maybe
she was with you.

19:27.488 --> 19:29.122
You're kidding, right?

19:29.124 --> 19:31.291
I mean, come on,
Alan's the ladies' man.

19:31.293 --> 19:32.508
He's a total
pickup artist.

19:32.510 --> 19:33.659
Come on!

19:33.661 --> 19:35.929
Charlie's dead,
Walden's married,

19:35.931 --> 19:38.798
what's wrong
with me?!

19:39.600 --> 19:41.768
♪ Men. ♪

19:44.346 --> 19:45.597
♪ Men. ♪

19:45.599 --> 19:46.681
So, I was thinking

19:46.683 --> 19:48.316
we could go out to
dinner sometime.

19:48.318 --> 19:50.435
Let me prove that
I can change.

19:50.437 --> 19:51.703
I can be a grown-up.

19:51.705 --> 19:53.671
I guess I owe you
that much.

19:53.673 --> 19:56.040
Sweet!

19:57.076 --> 19:59.143
Sorry to interrupt.

19:59.145 --> 20:01.729
I was just on a little jog
with my lady.

20:01.731 --> 20:03.448
Uh, I'll, uh,

20:03.450 --> 20:04.782
get out of your way.

20:04.784 --> 20:06.417
Uh, hold on.

20:06.419 --> 20:09.420
I'm-I'm going to say
good-bye to my guest,

20:09.422 --> 20:12.207
because that's the grown-up
thing to do, right?

20:18.797 --> 20:20.265
Alan, thank you.

20:20.267 --> 20:21.916
You saved my
butt back there.

20:21.918 --> 20:23.885
Oh, I'm glad
things are working out.

20:23.887 --> 20:24.936
I owe you big-time.

20:24.938 --> 20:26.387
If there's anything
that you need,

20:26.389 --> 20:29.157
any way I can help you,
you just let me know.

20:30.943 --> 20:35.647
Well, since you mention it,
you could do me a little favor.

20:35.649 --> 20:36.614
Name it.

20:36.616 --> 20:38.233
Well, really uncomfortable

20:38.235 --> 20:39.367
living at my mom's.

20:39.369 --> 20:41.819
Um, do you think I could
stay here for a few days

20:41.821 --> 20:43.104
till I find my own place?

20:43.106 --> 20:44.372
No problem.

20:44.374 --> 20:46.274
Few days, couple weeks.

20:46.276 --> 20:47.292
Yeah, done.

20:47.294 --> 20:49.610
Month, tops.

20:49.612 --> 20:51.079
Whatever.

20:51.081 --> 20:52.446
Great, great. Thanks.

20:52.448 --> 20:53.831
And, uh, and don't worry,

20:53.833 --> 20:55.550
I'm not one
to overstay my welcome.

20:55.552 --> 20:56.751
Cool.

21:00.539 --> 21:01.873
I'm back.

21:01.875 --> 21:05.875
== sync, corrected by &lt;font color="#00ff00">elderman&lt;/font> ==
